From: Boxedwine project
Subject: [PATCH] ddraw: Measure legacy screen extents for unit picking.

Apply the shared wine11_ddraw_extents.patch over the WebGL series.
Only surrounding context differs; retain the WebGL RHW upload helper
and CPU vertex-buffer lifetime fix. See tools/buildWine/probes/d3d7-extents.c.

---
--- a/dlls/ddraw/ddraw_private.h
+++ b/dlls/ddraw/ddraw_private.h
